      "description_en": "Antico Caffè Ventimiglia, one of Palermo's oldest cafés, is one of the venues that most comprehensively preserves the city's historic café culture with its 19th-century interior atmosphere, taxidermy display, and old photographs. Its proximity just a few steps away from the 'Quattro Canti' square makes it the most valuable of coffee moments in Palermo both historically and locationally.",
